st read and ends after every fixed query and independent assertion; includes observed journal stdout, excludes database create/close and process launch. Commit/checkpoint are existing disjoint diagnostics, never summed into total. Query elapsed excludes assertions and stdout; majority excludes query clone, serialization and source preparation.","modes":"Ordinary API/CLI uses deferred; builtin benchmark uses inline. Probe invokes their exact shared measured_in path; it is not a new public mode/CLI flag or standard benchmark artifact. transient_only import is unsupported.","statistics":"Nearest rank ceil(p*n)-1 from unrounded measured20/round and pooled40; first/warmup retained separately. Both repetitions reported; no fastest selection.","resources":"Whole-process peak RSS via /usr/bin/time -l; no per-phase RSS attribution. File/index sizes from actual stats. Input bytes known, physical IO/CPU/temporary peak unavailable and not zero.","cache":"No OS page-cache eviction; majority reopened handle each round; shared host scheduling uncontrolled.","failure_policy":"Abort after any failed/invalid/timed-out trial, retain raw started events, terminal failure, prior successes and not_run; kill only owned process group. Source and original database hashes verified before/after.","limitations":["Synthetic narrow diagnostic, not semantic quality or new product thresholds","No mac-to-linux performance extrapolation","Two import samples/group; no import P95 claim","Only missing groups supplemented; old protocol verdicts unchanged"]}
